      },
      "dc:source": "privacy-legislation-amendment-emergencies-and-disasters-act-2006.pdf, p.7",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, a reference in the definition of\npersonal information in subsection 6(1) to an individual is taken to\ninclude a reference to an individual who is not living.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the purposes of this Part, a reference in the definition of\npersonal information in subsection 6(1) to an individual is taken to\ninclude a reference to an individual who is not living.",
